s=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A list item that is open, which makes it the last item of its list so far.\n* `list` is the list that the item belongs to, with the items that closed before this one.\n* `marker` is this item's bullet or ordered marker.\n* `contentColumn` is the column at which the item's content begins. Subsequent lines must be\n  indented to at least this column to count as continuations of this item (CommonMark §5.2).","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/BlockZipper.html#Lean.Markdown.OpenContainer.listItem","kind":"ctor","line":35,"name":"Lean.Markdown.OpenContainer.listItem","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/BlockZipper.lean#L35-L42"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/BlockZipper.html#Lean.Markdown.OpenContainer.blockquote\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">OpenContainer</span>.<span class=\"name\">blockquote</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">markers</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Subslice.html#String.Slice.Subslice\">Subslice</a></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/BlockZipper.html#Lean.Markdown.OpenContainer\">OpenContainer</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A blockquote. `markers` accumulates the `>` markers from\nevery continuation line that has been seen so far.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/BlockZipper.html#Lean.Markdown.OpenContainer.blockquote","kind":"ctor","line":30,"name":"Lean.Markdown.OpenContainer.blockquote","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/BlockZipper.lean#L30-L34"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">inductive</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/BlockZipper.html#Lean.Markdown.OpenContainer\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">OpenContainer</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A container that is currently open and may still receive child blocks.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/BlockZipper.html#Lean.Markdown.OpenContainer","kind":"inductive","line":26,"name":"Lean.Markdown.OpenContainer","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/BlockZipper.lean#L26-L43"}}],"imports":["Init","Lean.Data.Markdown.Block","Lean.Data.Markdown.InlineSource","Lean.Data.Markdown.Parser.Children","Lean.Data.Markdown.Parser.Html"],"instances":[{"className":"Inhabited","name":"Lean.Markdown.instInhabitedOpenContainer","typeNames":["Lean.Markdown.OpenContainer"]},{"className":"Inhabited","name":"Lean.Markdown.instInhabitedZipperFrame","typeNames":["Lean.Markdown.ZipperFrame"]},{"className":"Inhabited","name":"Lean.Markdown.instInhabitedOpenLeaf","typeNames":["Lean.Markdown.OpenLeaf"]},{"className":"Inhabited","name":"Lean.Markdown.instInhabitedBlockZipper","typeNames":["Lean.Markdown.BlockZipper"]}],"name":"Lean.Da